message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Robust MPC"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB/Julia functions for modeling, analysis and control of Modular Multilevel
  Converters (MMCs) and Multi-Terminal DC (MTDC) systems, including a framework
  for commissioning and validating robust state-feedback controllers and robust
  model predictive controllers (via controller matching with vertex relaxation),
  with deployment on RTDS through CBuilder blocks.
